## Pi compatibility

Pi loads skills with its `read` tool. Keep the interview above unchanged.

If a subagent tool is available, start research subagents with a fresh context
window. Pi does not provide subagents by default. Without that capability,
research discoverable facts yourself using the available tools; do not invent
a subagent tool or claim that delegated research is running. Ask independent
questions while research is outstanding whenever the available tools allow it.
